  "description": "GroupDocs.Search for .NET is an easy-to-use document search library which performs search operations over various file formats - DOC, XLS, PPT, ODP and many others. The search API allows you to create a search index with flexible settings for different requirements: quick and lightweight document search or advanced document search features. Customize search index with custom fields and search your custom data along with document text and metadata.",
